rough once.\n\n**Payment:** PAY0001 sent $2,542.38 by wire from the operating account to Evergreen Catering for invoice INV-97297. The payment status is \"sent,\" and it's the only payment on the account.\n\n**Why the amount is lower than the original invoice:** My first try was for the original $2,763.46, and the system rejected it because that didn't match the invoice balance. Nothing was sent. When I checked the invoice again, a credit memo (CM-7297, \u2212$221.08) had been applied, so the balance was $2,542.38. That's the amount I paid. It's under $10,000, so controller approval wasn't needed.\n\n**Not paid:** Evergreen has two other invoices. INV-10511 was already paid. INV-39839 ($6,223.89) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}